FILE: README.md
FEATURE: font-splash-module
DATE: 2026-10-06
PRIOR STATE: as of commit cd3ca10 (Add SketchPad drawing module; remove DOMDrawer)

REASON
The v4.0.0-beta feature list names the new module.

OLD_SECTION
- Skeleton module (`vUX-skeleton.js`), for placeholder screens ...
- SketchPad module (`vUX-sketchPad.js`), ...

NEW_SECTION
- Skeleton module (`vUX-skeleton.js`), for placeholder screens ...
- FontSplash module (`vUX-fontSplash.js`), a splash screen whose loader is a word in your own font, with a gradient flowing through the letters as they fade in a wave; full-screen or over one element, determinate or not, and never shown in the wrong font
- SketchPad module (`vUX-sketchPad.js`), ...
